---

---

<section class="section-trust">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center header">
            <span class="badge">PROOF</span>
            <h2>숫자로 증명하는<br />실전 마케팅 노하우</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="metrics-grid">
            <div class="metric-item">
                <div class="value">300<span class="unit">%</span></div>
                <div class="label">
                    평균 매출 성장률<span class="tag">예시</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="separator"></div>
            <div class="metric-item">
                <div class="value">50<span class="unit">+</span></div>
                <div class="label">
                    운영 레퍼런스<span class="tag">예시</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="separator"></div>
            <div class="metric-item">
                <div class="value">1<span class="unit">위</span></div>
                <div class="label">
                    지역 맛집 랭킹<span class="tag">예시</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="separator"></div>
            <div class="metric-item">
                <div class="value">98<span class="unit">%</span></div>
                <div class="label">
                    고객 유지율<span class="tag">예시</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="disclaimer text-center">
            ※ 위 수치는 이해를 돕기 위한 예시이며, 실제 결과는 업종/지역/시즌에
            따라 달라질 수 있습니다.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .section-trust {
        background: var(--color-bg-dark);
        color: white;
        padding: 100px 0;
    }

    .badge {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-accent);
        padding: 6px 16px;
        border-radius: 100px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        display: inline-block;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .metrics-grid {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-around;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .metric-item {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1rem;
    }

    .value {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--color-accent);
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .unit {
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-left: 5px;
    }

    .label {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 6px;
    }

    .tag {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        padding: 2px 6px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .separator {
        width: 1px;
        height: 60px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .disclaimer {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .metrics-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem 0;
        }
        .separator {
            display: none;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
        }
        .value {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        }
    }
</style>
